{"name":"Adriatic","hex":"#014a69","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Adriatic","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or pertaining to the Adriatic Sea."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A sea between Italy and the Balkan Peninsula; an extension of the Mediterranean located between the boot of Italy and the Dalmatian coast of the Balkans; in full, Adriatic Sea."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Adriatic"}],"entries":[{"title":"Adriatic Sea","blocks":[{"text":"The Adriatic Sea is a body of water separating the Italian Peninsula from the Balkan Peninsula. The Adriatic is the northernmost arm of the Mediterranean Sea, extending from the Strait of Otranto to the northwest and the Po Valley. The countries with coasts on the Adriatic are Albania, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Croatia, Italy, Montenegro, and Slovenia."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Adriatic_Sea_2003.jpg/330px-Adriatic_Sea_2003.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adriatic_Sea","wikidata":"Q13924"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Bucht_von_Kotor.jpg/500px-Bucht_von_Kotor.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Bucht_von_Kotor.jpg/1280px-Bucht_von_Kotor.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Bucht_von_Kotor.jpg/500px-Bucht_von_Kotor.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bay of Kotor, a ria in the Southern Adriatic","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABucht_von_Kotor.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Gjipe_beach%2C_Albania.JPG/500px-Gjipe_beach%2C_Albania.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_cont